<title>FINLAND: Metsa-Serla sells chemicals plants.</title>
<headline>Metsa-Serla sells chemicals plants.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish forest industry group Metsa-Serla Oy said in a statement on Wednesday it had signed a letter of intent with Swedish  Industri Kapital for the sale of its chemicals operations for 1.05 billion markka.</p>
<p>&quot;The sale of the chemicals business is in line with Metsa-Serla's strategy of focussing on its key business areas, which are printing papers and packaging materials,&quot; it said.</p>
</text>
